  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220ºC/200ºC fan-forced.\n• Finely chop garlic, tomato, celery and silverbeet.\n• Thinly slice red onion.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185aa5917498f8bf2daee/step-28ee5100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion, stirring until softened, 5-6 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and a splash of water and mix well. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes. Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185aa5917498f8bf2daee/step-82f39110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add plant-based mince and celery and cook, breaking up with a spoon, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add tomato and silverbeet and cook until tender, 3-4 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185aa5917498f8bf2daee/step-d7ea5920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add All-American spice blend, tomato paste and garlic and cook, stirring until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the water and cook until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes. Stir through caramelised onion and season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185aa5917498f8bf2daee/step-72b77230.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small microwave-safe bowl, microwave the butter in 10 second bursts until melted.\n• Transfer veggie mincec filling to a baking dish.\n• Lightly scrunch each sheet of filo pastry (see ingredients) and place on top of beef mixture to completely cover.\n• Gently brush melted butter over to coat. Bake pie until the pastry is golden, 15-20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185aa5917498f8bf2daee/step-2b150440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide All-American plant-based mince and caramelised onion pie between plates to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185aa5917498f8bf2daee/step-e3a12550.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
